				"navigation_title": "Welcome!",
				"title": "Welcome to our event!",
				"show_description": true,
				"description": "<p><strong>Call for Speakers</strong></p>\n<p>Our event is the premiere event welcoming leaders, practitioners, and change-makers from all around the world to collaborate and learn from the best. Sessions for our agenda will be selected from these submissions.</p>\n<p>Our conference will take place on X date at Y time.</p>\n<p>Here are the different tracks we offering:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Topic A</li>\n<li>Topic B</li>\n<li>Topic C</li>\n<li>Topic D</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you're interested in submitting a topic for us to consider, please use the following form. You can use the portal to keep up to date on the status of your submissions. If approved, you'll receive a list of tasks to complete within the portal.</p>\n<p><strong>Helpful Tips and Important Information</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.website.com\" target=\"_blank\">Speaker Agreement Terms and Conditions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.website.com\" target=\"_blank\">FAQs for Speaker Application Process</a>  </li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.website.com\" target=\"_blank\">Speaker Tips and Resources Guide</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Dates and Deadlines</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Call for Speakers will open <strong>X Date.</strong></li>\n<li>Presentation submissions are due by <strong>Y Date, </strong>by <strong>11:59 PM EST </strong></li>\n<li><em>(Late submissions will not be accepted, no exceptions.)</em></li>\n<li>Our event will take place the week of X Date.</li>\n</ul>",
